1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
So this is the room. Two years of saving and about four weekends of building.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,900
I want to walk you through what I bought, what I made, and the three things I got wrong.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Starting with the desk, because everybody asks. It is a solid beech worktop from a kitchen shop.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:18,000
Forty pounds a metre, cut to size in store, and it is better than anything sold as a desk.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,700
The legs are off the shelf steel frames. Nothing clever. The whole thing came to about two hundred.

6
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,600
Acoustic treatment. This is the part I got wrong first time and I want to save you the money.

7
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:39,200
I bought foam. Foam does almost nothing below about five hundred hertz.

8
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:43,800
What you actually want is thick mineral wool in a frame, covered in whatever fabric you like.

9
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:48,400
Same money, three times the effect, and you can build one in an evening with a saw and a stapler.

10
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,600
Lighting. One key light through a diffuser, one weak fill, one light on the background.

11
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:24,100
That is it. Three lights. Every setup you have seen with nine lights is showing off.

12
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:28,800
The background light is the one people skip and it is the one doing the most work.

13
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:44,500
Three mistakes. One, I put the desk against the window and fought the daylight for a month.

14
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:49,100
Two, I ran the cables before I knew where anything was going and did it all again in April.

15
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:53,700
Three, I bought a chair on looks. Sit in the chair before you buy the chair.

16
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:06,400
Full parts list with prices is in the description, and it is not affiliate linked, I just made a sheet.

17
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:10,900
If you build one of these, send me a photo. I like seeing them. Thanks for watching.
